        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions MDS01, Madison Rope Door Pull with Ornate Mounts</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis stunningly designed Classic Madison Door Pull combines the traditional beauty of a rope handle with decorative, oversized finials. The Madison Classic Door Pull can be used on either residential or commercial doors. Choose from thru-bolt mounting or surface mounting in 26 inch or 30 inch lengths. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/classic-madison-back-to-back-door-pull-first-impressions-pr-mds01\"><b>Pair Back-to-Back Mounted</b></a>. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Madison Series 1 Pull:\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass Tubing</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-MDS01-specifications.pdf?v=1704262301\"><b>First Impressions MDS01 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>FII-MDS01026:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 26\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 4.21\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.54\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-MDS01030:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 30\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 4.21\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.54\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This First Impressions door pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including different center to center mounting distances and  <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> <a href=\"/products/classic-madison-back-to-back-door-pull-first-impressions-pr-mds01\"><b>First Impressions Model PR-MDS01</b></a>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle).</i>\r\n</p>",
