                "description": "This stunningly designed Classic Madison Door Pull combines the traditional beauty of a rope handle with decorative, oversized finials. The Madison Classic Door Pull can be used on either residential or commercial doors. Choose from thru-bolt mounting or surface mounting in 26 inch or 30 inch lengths. \r\n",
